description:
At Flix, we offer a tech-driven environment where innovation meets real-world impact, with competitive pay, strong growth opportunities, and a culture of collaboration and ownership. &nbsp;

About the Role

Team Market Data Insights (MDI) in the Supply Division is the team behind Flix's data products for internal use, including market intelligence, sociodemographic, and holiday data. Our data is used worldwide across markets and commercial functions, as well as data science teams, to power demand forecasting, dynamic pricing, and network planning decisions.

About You

We're looking for solid technical foundations, curiosity, and the drive to grow into a strong Data Engineer. You'll get hands-on ownership quickly and learn from senior engineers in a collaborative, supportive environment. &nbsp;

We'd love to hear from you if: &nbsp;

• You have some programming experience - for example with Python (or Java/Scala). This could come from a first job, an internship, university, a bootcamp, or your own projects &nbsp;

• You've worked with SQL and understand the basics of tables, queries, and working with data &nbsp;

• You're curious about how data moves through systems and how pipelines are built and improved &nbsp;

• You enjoy solving problems and don't mind digging into something you haven't seen before &nbsp;

• You're keen to learn from others, ask questions, and share your own ideas. &nbsp;

• You enjoy working with people from different technical and non-technical backgrounds. &nbsp;

• You are open to different programming languages as well as other areas outside of Data Engineering, e.g., Frontend or data science &nbsp;

• You are excited to use AI and want to become AI-fluent &nbsp;

• Nice to have: Experience with data pipelines, data modelling, BI tools, or data and cloud platform products (e.g., AWS, Snowflake);&nbsp;

• A utomated testing, CI/CD, clean code, and software engineering practices &nbsp;

We recognize that everyone carries a unique set of valuable skills and experiences. If you think you could have an impact even though you don't meet 100% of the requirements, we still encourage you to apply. We want to hear from you! &nbsp;

What We Offer

• Travel perks : 12 free Flix vouchers + 12 discount vouchers for friends &amp; family.&nbsp;

• Work from (M)Anywhere : Depending on your role, work from another location for up to 60 days per year.&nbsp;

• Hybrid work model : We are an office-first company, but we offer flexibility to balance work and life.&nbsp;

• Wellbeing support : Access confidential 1:1 counselling, courses, and stress management for yourself and up to four family members.&nbsp;

• Learning &amp; Development : Take advantage of language classes, training courses, and expert-led sessions to grow your skills.&nbsp;

• Mentoring Program : Connect with experienced colleagues to gain insights and accelerate your career.&nbsp;

To view more local benefits specific to each office location, please check out this link:&nbsp; Locations - Flix Career

Why Join Flix?

At Flix, we empower our teams to push boundaries and shape the future of mobility. As we continue to scale globally, we harness cutting-edge technology to make mobility smarter, more sustainable, and more affordable.

If you’re looking for a place where you can drive change and redefine how millions of people travel, Flix is the place where you can lead your journey!&nbsp;

